{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>樂壇天后謝安琪與COLLAR成員蘇雅琳（Ivy So）近日破天荒合唱新歌《葬花辭》，兩代女神同框瞬間引爆全城熱 …</p><p></p>\n<p>樂壇天后謝安琪與COLLAR成員蘇雅琳（Ivy So）近日破天荒合唱新歌《葬花辭》，兩代女神同框瞬間引爆全城熱話。隨著新歌古典造型曝光，大批網民隨即翻出謝安琪於12年前拍攝的一輯極致誘惑旗袍床照作對比。這組相隔多年的絕密舊照意外流出，讓這場跨世代魅力對決出現意想不到震撼賽果。</p>\n<h2>謝安琪蘇雅琳合唱《葬花辭》引爆熱話</h2>\n<p>謝安琪與蘇雅琳這次驚喜聯手推出全新合唱作品《葬花辭》，宣傳海報中兩人以純白上衣配搭牛仔褲造型背對背而坐，在漫天飛花與湖水綠背景襯托下散發濃厚文藝氣息。雖然兩位歌手年齡相差一截，但同框畫面卻展現出極高契合度，將古典詩意與現代唯美完美融合。這首跨世代合唱作品一經發布，立刻在各大社交平台洗版，雙方粉絲紛紛大讚這次合作為神仙組合。</p>\n<h2>雙方粉絲激讚《葬花辭》為神仙級組合</h2>\n<p>面對這次突如其來跨世代夢幻聯動，大批樂迷及雙方粉絲立刻在各大討論區及社交平台瘋狂洗版，給予極高評價。不少粉絲留言直呼「大癲」，認為兩位歌手聲線與氣質出奇合拍，將歌曲中蘊含古典意境演繹得淋漓盡致。這股熱潮更迅速蔓延至各大粉絲群組，大家紛紛截圖轉發宣傳海報，將這次破天荒合作視為本年度最具驚喜音樂企劃，成功為新歌造勢。</p>\n<h2>網民翻出謝安琪12年前極致誘惑舊照</h2>\n<p>由於新歌充滿古典詩意，不少資深網民立刻聯想起蘇雅琳過往多次引發熱議旗袍造型，並順勢展開一場網絡考古行動。有網民翻出謝安琪於2014年10月為雜誌拍攝一輯經典封面及內頁寫真，當年她換上粉白底色配以大紅牡丹花紋貼身旗袍，斜臥在床榻及中式貴妃椅上。高衩剪裁完美展現其玲瓏浮凸曲線，配以復古紅唇與迷離眼神，將東方女性嫵媚與成熟韻味徹底釋放。</p>\n<h2>兩代女神旗袍造型對比引發網民熱烈討論</h2>\n<p>這組相隔12年出土舊照與蘇雅琳過往清純仙氣旗袍造型放在一起對比後，隨即在討論區引爆激烈討論。大批網民給予兩位女神高度評價，有人留言大讚：「Ivy So係青春無敵、清純仙氣，但Kay媽當年呢輯旗袍床照真係風華絕代，完全係天花板級數！」也有網民表示「12年前嘅謝安琪真係一啲都唔輸蝕，甚至多咗份女人味」，認為兩人各有千秋，這次合作絕對是視覺與聽覺雙重享受。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560231629795780_792659106b06b78d60679.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6069124205178984045.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560231629795780_792659106b06b78d60679.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ivyysooo）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560231843888152_14576392026b06b78ed3bf7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6069124205178984046.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560231843888152_14576392026b06b78ed3bf7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ivyysooo）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560231951222160_4216936086b06b78fdb995.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6069124205178984043.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560231951222160_4216936086b06b78fdb995.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>翻出謝安琪12年前極致誘惑舊照（圖片來源：新傳媒圖片庫）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560232043418135_9085359286b06b790c07e4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6069124205178984044.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179560232043418135_9085359286b06b790c07e4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：新傳媒圖片庫）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956023211887726_2335715236b06b791c644c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6069124205178984047.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956023211887726_2335715236b06b791c644c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ivyysooo）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%91%ac%e8%8a%b1%e8%be%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">葬花辭</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%98%87%e9%9b%85%e7%90%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蘇雅琳</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%ac%9d%e5%ae%89%e7%90%aa/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">謝安琪</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3550066\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 25 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T11:54:48.087851+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1345,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T10:25:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T16:37:53.517068+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T11:48:14.410366+00:00","content_hash":"70acc654359eafa22492d0b4eff1c6e1f36121330cf9737f8ca1c3f2f246de32","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}